# Generated files: `mise run gen-write` writes them and `mise run gen-check`
# fails when one is stale. `linguist-generated` collapses them in GitHub diffs
# and excludes them from language statistics; local `git diff` still shows
# them so a regeneration can be reviewed. `scripts/tests/test_gate_parity.py`
# checks every root in `scripts/generation_digest.py` is covered here.

# Rust-generated JSON Schemas, reference data and contract fixtures
finstack-quant/*/schemas/** linguist-generated=true
finstack-quant/core/src/generated/** linguist-generated=true
finstack-quant/valuations/tests/instruments/json_examples/** linguist-generated=true
finstack-quant/valuations/tests/data/registry_snapshot.json linguist-generated=true

# WASM package
